      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237021/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir rice, coconut milk, and water together in a saucepan. Dissolve sugar into the liquid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q_3WEN0Iuf7mc2tpdwR-MSID0IA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237021-sweet-coconut-rice-ddmfs-step-2-BG-2881-b11e19a408914d009b87b5fdbdc746ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237021/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring the mixture to a simmer then reduce heat to medium-low. Cover the saucepan and simmer until the majority of the liquid has been absorbed by the rice, 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ePDEsa4udRMgXDmx1plW_Nc_76w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237021-sweet-coconut-rice-ddmfs-step-3-BG-2886-26a20b5d57134f22bd9cb041411aeb3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237021/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leaving the saucepan on the burner, turn the heat off and let rice steam until sticky, 5 to 10 minutes more.",
